  "body": "Rarely does an opportunity like this come to market in the heart of Manly. This substantial 1,036sqm (approx.) site presents excellent potential for developers, investors, or those seeking a premium residential project. Located just metres from Manly Village, the site offers easy access to shops, cafes, restaurants, bus stops, and both local beaches.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n*\tActive Wastewater Connection: The site benefits from an existing wastewater connection, making it easier to start your project.\r\n*\tStormwater Connection: Installed and consented, providing a key service already in place for future development.\r\n*\tMixed Housing Zone with potential development opportunities, subject to Council consent.\r\n*\tDual Access Potential: Existing right-of-way access from Whangaparaoa Road at the rear, with the possibility of direct driveway access from the northern boundary (subject to due-diligence and council approval).\r\n*\tFully Fenced & Surveyed: Boundary survey completed, with the property fully fenced for privacy and security.\r\n*\tBy Negotiation, with motivated vendors committed to achieving a sale. All reasonable offers will be presented for consideration.\r\n\r\nCurrently, the site is home to an older two-bedroom dwelling, being sold on an as-is, where-is basis. This is to ensure the existing wastewater connection remains active, and the site does not become classed as vacant land. \r\n\r\nThis cleared, flat site is ready for development. The location is exceptional, with nearby sections already successfully developed into multi-unit housing, setting a strong precedent for future projects in the area. \r\n\r\nAnother key consideration is the completion of Penlink in 2028, which will make this section even more sought after.\r\nSecure your stake in one of the Peninsula's most tightly held coastal suburbs.\r\n\r\nProperty Documents can be downloaded here: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/EXCS",
